./ R 00334000          $ 00334100 100                                           
         L     R2,VMSEG       GET SEGTABLE ADDRESS             XA0036DK         
         N     R2,=A(SEGSTOM) WITHOUT THE LENGTH               XA0036DK         
./ R 00336000          $ 00336100 100                                           
         SRDL  R0,20          SEGMENT TO LOW ORDER OF R0,      XA0036DK         
./ R 00339000          $ 00339100 100                                           
         TM    3(R2),SEGINVAL VALID SEGMENT                    XA0036DK         
./ R 00344000          $ 00344100 100                                           
         L     R2,0(,R2)      ADDRESS OF PAGTABLE              XA0036DK         
         N     R2,=A(SEGPTOM) WITHOUT THE FLAGS                XA0036DK         
./ R 00345000          $ 00345100 100                                           
*  AFTER SRDL 20 THE PAGE-WITHIN-SEGMENT FIELD IS R1 BITS      XA0036DK         
*  0-7, NOT 0-3, SO IT RIGHT-JUSTIFIES WITH 24 RATHER THAN     XA0036DK         
*  28.                                                         XA0036DK         
         SRL   R1,24          SHIFT PAGE TO LOWORDER OF R1     XA0036DK         
./ R 00347000          $ 00347100 100                                           
         LA    R2,256*L'PAGPFRA+(SWPFLAG-SWPVM)(R1,R2)         XA0036DK         
